===Etymology===
From {{etyl|grc|en}} {{term|κοσμοπολίτης||citizen of the world|tr=kosmopolites|lang=grc}} ({{term|κόσμος||world|tr=kosmos|lang=grc}} + {{term|πολίτης||citizen|tr=polites|lang=grc}}).

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# One who is at home in every place; a citizen of the world; a [[cosmopolitan]] person.
# {{context|US|lang=en}} The butterfly [[painted lady]] ({{taxlink|Vanessa cardui|species|noshow=1}}).

